      "prompt": "Prove algebraically that the difference between the squares of two consecutive odd numbers is always a multiple of 8.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "Let two consecutive odd numbers be 2n + 1 and 2n + 3 (for integer n).",
        "Write the given expression algebraically: (2n + 3)^2 - (2n + 1)^2.",
